# Signing material. `key.properties` is written by hand locally or by the CI signing step; the
# keystore itself is decoded next to it at build time. Neither may ever be committed — this repo is
# public, and a leaked signing key lets anyone publish an APK that Android treats as an update to
# this one.
*.jks
*.keystore
